- **Scope mismatch vs required pages/features**: the task includes broader finalization items (full CRUD/form validation consistency, accessibility pass across icon buttons/tooltips, complete page-banner standardization, performance/bug sweep). This diff addresses subsets only and does not provide evidence of completion for the full acceptance criteria.

